sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Dashboard
    participant API as Backend

    U->>FE: Create agent (name, type, model, system prompt)
    FE->>API: POST /api/agents
    API-->>FE: 201 Created (status=draft)

    U->>FE: Activate agent
    FE->>API: PUT /api/agents/{id} {status: active}
    API-->>FE: 200 OK

    U->>FE: Create widget (agent_id, knowledge_base_id, theme)
    FE->>API: POST /api/widgets
    API-->>FE: 201 Created (public_key, status=draft)

    U->>FE: Publish widget
    FE->>API: POST /api/widgets/{id}/publish?publish=true
    API-->>FE: 200 status=published

    U->>FE: Copy embed snippet
    FE-->>U: <script src=".../widget.js" data-key="public_key">
    Note over U: Paste into their website — visitor traffic now reaches the agent
